---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Tax Preparation" description="Professional tax preparation and filing services for individuals and businesses. Enrolled Agent with 15+ years of IRS experience.">
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="mb-6">Tax Preparation</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted font-sans mb-8">Prepare and file your tax returns with confidence — backed by an ex-IRS professional who knows the system inside and out.</p>

      <div class="prose font-sans">
        <h3 class="mt-12 mb-4">What We Handle</h3>
        <p class="mb-4">Individual and business federal and state returns, including complex situations such as multi-state filing, self-employment, rental income, capital gains, and cryptocurrency transactions.</p>

        <h3 class="mt-12 mb-4">Our Approach</h3>
        <p class="mb-4">Every return is prepared with the same thoroughness Nitasha applied during her years at the IRS. We identify legitimate deductions and credits while ensuring full compliance — minimizing your risk of future IRS scrutiny.</p>

        <h3 class="mt-12 mb-4">Who This Is For</h3>
        <p class="mb-4">Individuals with complex tax situations, small business owners, independent contractors, crypto investors, and anyone who wants their returns handled by someone who has seen thousands of returns from the IRS side.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
